### Staff API HTTP 联调示例
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件或 JetBrains HTTP Client 直接运行
### 后端需先启动: cd backend && mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=dev

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 10
@storeId = 1

### ========== Dict ==========

### 获取零件分类字典项
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/dict/types/PART_CATEGORY/items

### 获取支付方式字典项
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/dict/types/PAYMENT_METHOD/items

### 查询不存在的字典类型（应返回空数组）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/dict/types/NONEXISTENT/items

### ========== Part ==========

### 查询启用配件列表（分页）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按配件名称搜索
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts?partName=电池&pageSize=5
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按来源筛选官方配件
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts?source=OFFICIAL
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取配件详情（48V20Ah电池，ID=100）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts/100
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取停用配件详情（ID=107，应返回 PART_NOT_FOUND）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts/107
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取不存在的配件（应返回 PART_NOT_FOUND）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts/99999
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 缺少 dev header（应返回 COMMON_BAD_REQUEST）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/parts

### ========== Inventory ==========

### 查询库存列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按配件编码搜索库存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks?partCode=TEST
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取指定配件库存详情（partId=100，48V20Ah电池）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks/100
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取不存在的库存（应返回错误）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks/99999
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 缺少 dev header（应返回 COMMON_BAD_REQUEST）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/inventory/stocks

### ========== WorkOrder ==========

### 查询工单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按客户姓名搜索工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?customerName=刘明
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按状态筛选草稿工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?status=DRAFT
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 按车架号搜索工单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders?vehicleFrameNo=LFV000001
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取工单详情（DRAFT工单，ID=400）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/400
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 获取不存在的工单（应返回 WORK_ORDER_NOT_FOUND）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/99999
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### 跨门店访问（应返回 WORK_ORDER_NOT_FOUND）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/400
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: 2

### 缺少 dev header（应返回 COMMON_BAD_REQUEST）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders

### ========== Work Order Draft Write ==========

### 创建工单草稿
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "customerNameSnapshot": "张三",
  "customerPhoneSnapshot": "13800138000",
  "vehicleModelSnapshot": "NQi",
  "frameNoSnapshot": "FRAME001",
  "batteryNoSnapshot": "BAT001",
  "repairItem": "更换轮胎",
  "remark": "紧急维修"
}

### 创建工单草稿 - 缺少 customerNameSnapshot（失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "repairItem": "更换轮胎"
}

### 修改草稿基础信息
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/draft
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "customerNameSnapshot": "李四",
  "repairItem": "更换电机",
  "remark": "更新备注"
}

### 修改草稿 - 非 DRAFT 状态（失败）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/999/draft
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "customerNameSnapshot": "李四"
}

### ========== Charge Items ==========

### 添加 PART 费用明细
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/charge-items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "chargeType": "PART",
  "itemName": "48V20Ah电池",
  "partId": 100,
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 120.50
}

### 添加 PART 费用明细 - 缺少 partId（失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/charge-items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "chargeType": "PART",
  "itemName": "电池",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 100.00
}

### 添加 LABOR 费用明细
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/charge-items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "chargeType": "LABOR",
  "itemName": "维修工时",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 50.00
}

### 添加 OTHER 费用明细
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/charge-items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "chargeType": "OTHER",
  "itemName": "运输费",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 30.00
}

### 添加费用明细 - quantity=0（失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/charge-items
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "chargeType": "LABOR",
  "itemName": "工时",
  "quantity": 0,
  "unitPrice": 50.00
}

### 修改费用明细
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/charge-items/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "itemName": "48V20Ah电池",
  "quantity": 3,
  "unitPrice": 130.00
}

### 删除费用明细
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/charge-items/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

### ========== Work Order Submit ==========

### 提交工单草稿（触发 RESERVE 预占库存，不收款、不结算）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "remark": "客户确认维修方案，提交工单"
}

### 重复提交 / 非 DRAFT 工单提交（应返回 WORK_ORDER_NOT_DRAFT）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{}

### 跨门店提交（应返回 WORK_ORDER_NOT_FOUND）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: 2

{}

### ========== Work Order Cancel ==========

### 取消 DRAFT 工单（不释放库存，不生成 RELEASE）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "reason": "客户暂不维修",
  "remark": "客户稍后再联系"
}

### 取消已提交未结算工单（释放预占库存，生成 RELEASE）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/2/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "reason": "客户取消维修"
}

### 取消工单 - 缺少 reason（应返回 COMMON_BAD_REQUEST）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "reason": ""
}

### 重复取消 / 已结算工单取消（应返回 WORK_ORDER_CANCEL_NOT_ALLOWED）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: {{storeId}}

{
  "reason": "重复取消"
}

### 跨门店取消（应返回 WORK_ORDER_NOT_FOUND）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/work-orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
X-Store-Id: 2

{
  "reason": "跨店取消"
}
